+26 Nov 2026
+phpday 2027 - Call for Papers
+The 24th edition of phpday takes place
+on May 13–14, 2027, at Hotel San Marco in Verona, Italy, and online.
+The conference is organized by GrUSP,
+and all talks are in English. Founded in 2003, phpday is one of the
+three longest-running PHP conferences in Europe and one of the four
+longest-running PHP conferences worldwide.
+The call for papers
+is open through December 13, 2026. The organizers welcome talks rooted
+in real-world PHP development, from modernizing legacy codebases and
+exploring emerging technologies to building secure, high-performance
+applications and contributing to the open source ecosystem.
+You can submit up to three proposals.
+Tickets for phpday 2027 are already on sale.
